<p>In our analysis of hundreds of STR investments, several recurring mistakes stand out when it comes to airbnb co-hosting. The first is analysis paralysis. Some investors spend months or years researching without ever making a move. While education is important, there is a point of diminishing returns where additional research does not reduce risk, it just delays progress.</p>

