<p>The challenge with a tools-based approach is integration. You end up managing a stack of different platforms, each solving one piece of the puzzle, and spending significant time making them work together. For investors with the technical inclination and the time to invest, this approach can work well. For those who would rather focus on deal sourcing and portfolio strategy, it adds another layer of operational complexity.</p>

