<p>Our recommendation: evaluate Rabbu based on the specific problem it solves and whether that problem is your biggest bottleneck. If it is, the platform is worth trying. If your bigger challenge is finding the time and expertise to manage the entire STR operation, consider whether a <a href="https://bnbaccelerator.com">done-for-you approach</a> might be a more effective use of your investment capital.</p>

